<LegalLayout title="Terms & Conditions — Casa Serena" description="Booking terms, cancellation policy, and house rules for Casa Serena estate." heading="Terms & Conditions">
  <h2>1. Reservations</h2>
  <p>All reservations are subject to availability and confirmation by our team. A booking is confirmed only upon receipt of the deposit and written confirmation from Casa Serena.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Minimum stay: 3 nights (5 nights during July–August)</li>
    <li>Check-in: 15:00 · Check-out: 11:00</li>
    <li>Early check-in and late check-out available on request (subject to availability)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Deposit & Payment</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A 50% deposit is required within 7 days of booking confirmation</li>
    <li>The remaining balance is due 30 days prior to arrival</li>
    <li>Bookings made within 30 days of arrival require full payment at time of booking</li>
    <li>We accept bank transfer, Visa, Mastercard, and American Express</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Cancellation Policy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>60+ days before arrival:</strong> Full refund minus €200 administrative fee</li>
    <li><strong>30–59 days:</strong> 50% of total booking value retained</li>
    <li><strong>Less than 30 days:</strong> No refund</li>
    <li><strong>No-show:</strong> Full charge applies</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We strongly recommend travel insurance that covers cancellation.</p>

  <h2>4. House Rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Maximum occupancy must be respected as per suite specifications</li>
    <li>The estate is non-smoking indoors; designated outdoor areas are available</li>
    <li>Quiet hours: 23:00–08:00</li>
    <li>Pets are welcome in the Garden Suite only, by prior arrangement (€50/night supplement)</li>
    <li>Events and celebrations require prior approval and may incur additional fees</li>
    <li>Guests are responsible for any damage beyond normal wear</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Liability</h2>
  <p>Casa Serena maintains comprehensive insurance. However, we are not liable for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Loss or damage to personal belongings (a safe is provided in each suite)</li>
    <li>Injuries resulting from misuse of facilities (pool, beach access, spa)</li>
    <li>Disruptions caused by force majeure (weather, strikes, natural events)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Children & Safety</h2>
  <p>Children are welcome. Please note that the estate features unfenced cliff edges, an infinity pool without barriers, and steep pathways. Children under 12 must be supervised at all times in outdoor areas.</p>

  <h2>7. Governing Law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Hellenic Republic. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Syros, Cyclades.</p>

  <h2>8. Contact</h2>
  <p>Casa Serena Estate<br />Oia, Santorini 847 02, Greece<br /><a href="mailto:info@casaserena.com">info@casaserena.com</a><br />+30 22860 00000</p>
</LegalLayout>
